# Cloud-sync conflict copies ("Actions 2.js", "index 3.html", …).
# The project folder is inside a syncing directory, which periodically drops
# stale duplicates next to the originals — including inside node_modules.
# They are never real work; keep them out of the repo entirely.
*\ [0-9].js
*\ [0-9].jsx
*\ [0-9].ts
*\ [0-9].tsx
*\ [0-9].json
*\ [0-9].html
*\ [0-9].css
*\ [0-9].md
*\ [0-9].mjs
*\ [0-9].test.js

# Local Claude Code tooling state (contains machine-specific permissions)
.claude/
